{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2025-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1739577600, "end_date": 1740182399, "month_true_total": 245, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:56:11 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "188424021", "author": {"steamid": "76561197984759964", "personaname": "O.S.O.G.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/OneSinOneGrace/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 31, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 31, "last_played": 1732493205, "avatar": "70a787de292a7eafc6d051e144fa59c51fb4af61"}, "language": "english", "review": "Lacks all in-game button remapping. Literally the most basic accessibility feature is absent from this game.\n\nDo better, Gunfire Games.", "timestamp_created": 1740157820, "timestamp_updated": 1740157820, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49438101053237915", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "188407667", "author": {"steamid": "76561199539610085", "personaname": "FATZ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199539610085/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 24706, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2364, "last_played": 1770754803, "avatar": "d48e57dc4672700340cfa24a7bd40409dee829f6"}, "language": "english", "review": "it has some bad bugs but it good", "timestamp_created": 1740143674, "timestamp_updated": 1740143674, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188382518", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000081743", "personaname": "FuriusGeorge", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198000081743/", "num_games_owned": 124, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 3494, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3494, "last_played": 1716528046, "avatar": "8fb9503a8127d047c8198111b35b3024ab4714cc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Remnant2 feels like it should be a better Remnant1 given the additional mechanics & added layers of customization, but it lost something & that something is what made the original a fun challenge. \n\nI'm not sure if it is the new layers of grinding (I didn't cap an archtype by the time I beat the game on nightmare), something about the controls, or something about the boss mechanics, but this game ends up feeling more like a chore even though I've spent much more time failing to beat the 1st game.", "timestamp_created": 1740107863, "timestamp_updated": 1740107863, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496987968683242798", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "188360867", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015024799", "personaname": "Steel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Steel77/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 72, "playtime_forever": 3369, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2114, "last_played": 1742781165, "avatar": "fc5d8974fd3b0cd4519d382edd70e89172d6da5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "9/10", "timestamp_created": 1740081649, "timestamp_updated": 1740081649, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.471014469861984253", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188347593", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004678281", "personaname": "Omen Doll", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198004678281/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 366, "playtime_forever": 6214, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6214, "last_played": 1739305959, "avatar": "5648af01e4ff499e28adf8458b8120d548bd3018"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you look for ever changing worlds, always something to discover and fun gameplay, especially in Multiplayer this game is for you.\nAlso I ahvent encountered a single bug in over 100 hours, so I suppose the bug from all the other negative reviews has since been resolved.\n\nStory wise its not the best and whoever forced the game into a cyberpunk twist should lose their job, just as much as the guy who decided the Labyrinth is a minecraft kids level where you fight literal slabs of rock.\n\nApart from that I would recommend everyone to look up what classes (called Archetypes) there are online and how to get them since the chance of you not ever finding them is rather high.\n\nAll that said, with only 3 different worlds the game gets very repetitive after some time and the DLCs are not really worth it since they add just more of the same instead of new worlds.", "timestamp_created": 1740068797, "timestamp_updated": 1740068868, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.634833455085754395", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}